---
import Document from '../layouts/Document.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<Document
  title="Accessibility"
  eyebrow="Trust"
  lead="We want everyone to be able to use this website, including people who use assistive technology."
  description="Spockhart's accessibility commitment for spockhart.com."
  updated="November 5, 2026"
>
  <h2>Our standard</h2>
  <p>We design and build this website to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 at level AA.</p>

  <h2>What that means in practice</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every page can be used with a keyboard alone, with a visible focus indicator.</li>
    <li>Text meets AA contrast requirements.</li>
    <li>Pages use proper headings, landmarks and labels so screen readers can navigate them.</li>
    <li>Animation is subtle and turns off when your device is set to reduce motion.</li>
    <li>Layouts reflow to a single column on small screens and when text is enlarged.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Tell us what is not working</h2>
  <p>
    If something on this site is hard to use, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> with the page and what happened.
    We will reply within {site.offer.replyWithin} and fix what we can.
  </p>
</Document>
